# FullCalendar Widget Implementation

## Overview
- Widgets: Develop three FullCalendar widgets for different user types: Patient, Doctor, and Admin.
- Multi-Tenancy: Use Filament's multi-tenancy to manage doctors working across multiple locations.
# FullCalendar Widget Implementation per SaluteOra

## Architettura con Parental STI

### Single Table Inheritance
- **Parental Package**: Utilizzo di `tightenco/parental` per STI
- **User Types**: Patient, Doctor, Admin (non ruoli ma tipi di utente)
- **Tenancy**: Sistema multi-tenant di Filament per gestione studi
- **Isolamento**: Dati automaticamente filtrati per permessi utente

### Modelli Base
```php
// User.php - Modello padre con STI
class User extends Authenticatable
{
    use HasChildren, HasFactory, Notifiable, HasApiTokens;

    protected array $childTypes = [
        'patient' => Patient::class,
        'doctor' => Doctor::class,
        'admin' => Admin::class,
    ];
}

// Doctor.php - Estende User con tenancy
class Doctor extends User
{
    use HasParent, BelongsToTenant;

    public function getTenantKey(): string
    {
        return 'studio_id';
    }
}
```

## Widget FullCalendar Implementati

### 1. PatientCalendarWidget
- **Estende**: `Saade\FilamentFullCalendar\Widgets\FullCalendarWidget`
- **Namespace**: `Modules\SaluteOra\Filament\Widgets\PatientCalendarWidget`
- **Modello**: `Appointment`
- **Vista**: `timeGridWeek`
- **Accesso**: Solo pazienti autenticati
- **Filtro**: `where('patient_id', auth()->id())`
- **Funzionalità**: Solo visualizzazione (sola lettura)

```php
class PatientCalendarWidget extends FullCalendarWidget
{
    use HasFullCalendarConfig;

    public Model|string|null $model = Appointment::class;
    protected static ?int $sort = 1;
    protected static ?string $maxHeight = '600px';

    public static function canView(): bool
    {
        return auth()->user()?->type === UserType::PATIENT;
    }

    public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
    {
        $cacheKey = $this->getCacheKey($fetchInfo);

        return cache()->remember($cacheKey, 300, function () use ($fetchInfo) {
            return Appointment::query()
                ->where('patient_id', auth()->id())
                ->whereBetween('start_time', [$fetchInfo['start'], $fetchInfo['end']])
                ->with(['doctor', 'studio'])
                ->limit(100)
                ->get()
                ->map(fn($appointment) => EventData::make()
                    ->id($appointment->id)
                    ->title($this->formatEventTitle($appointment))
                    ->start($appointment->start_time)
                    ->end($appointment->end_time)
                    ->backgroundColor($this->getAppointmentStatusColor($appointment->status->value))
                    ->borderColor($this->getAppointmentTypeColor($appointment->type->value))
                    ->textColor('#ffffff')
                    ->extendedProps([
                        'doctor_name' => $appointment->doctor?->full_name,
                        'status' => $appointment->status->value,
                        'type' => $appointment->type->value,
                        'tooltip' => $this->formatTooltip($appointment),
                        'can_edit' => false,
                    ])
                )
                ->toArray();
        });
    }

    public function getFormSchema(): array
    {
        return [
            'readonly_info' => Section::make('Informazioni')
                ->schema([
                    Placeholder::make('readonly_info')
                        ->content('I pazienti possono solo visualizzare i propri appuntamenti. Per modifiche, contattare il proprio medico.'),
                ]),
        ];
    }
}
```

### 2. DoctorCalendarWidget
- **Estende**: `Saade\FilamentFullCalendar\Widgets\FullCalendarWidget`
- **Namespace**: `Modules\SaluteOra\Filament\Widgets\DoctorCalendarWidget`
- **Modello**: `Appointment`
- **Vista**: `timeGridWeek`
- **Accesso**: Dottori con tenancy studio
- **Filtro**: `where('studio_id', Filament::getTenant()->id)`
- **Funzionalità**: CRUD completo, drag&drop, resize

```php
class DoctorCalendarWidget extends FullCalendarWidget
{
    use HasFullCalendarConfig;

    public Model|string|null $model = Appointment::class;
    protected static ?int $sort = 1;
    protected static ?string $maxHeight = '600px';

    public static function canView(): bool
    {
        return auth()->user()?->type === UserType::DOCTOR &&
               Filament::getTenant() !== null;
    }

    public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
    {
        $cacheKey = $this->getCacheKey($fetchInfo);

        return cache()->remember($cacheKey, 300, function () use ($fetchInfo) {
            $query = Appointment::query()
                ->where('studio_id', Filament::getTenant()->id)
                ->whereBetween('start_time', [$fetchInfo['start'], $fetchInfo['end']])
                ->with(['patient', 'doctor']);

            // Se non studio_admin, mostra solo propri appuntamenti
            if (!auth()->user()->hasRole('studio_admin')) {
                $query->where('doctor_id', auth()->id());
            }

            return $query->limit(100)
                ->get()
                ->map(fn($appointment) => EventData::make()
                    ->id($appointment->id)
                    ->title($this->formatEventTitle($appointment))
                    ->start($appointment->start_time)
                    ->end($appointment->end_time)
                    ->backgroundColor($this->getAppointmentTypeColor($appointment->type->value))
                    ->borderColor($this->getAppointmentStatusColor($appointment->status->value))
                    ->textColor('#ffffff')
                    ->extendedProps([
                        'patient_name' => $appointment->patient?->full_name,
                        'doctor_name' => $appointment->doctor?->full_name,
                        'status' => $appointment->status->value,
                        'type' => $appointment->type->value,
                        'tooltip' => $this->formatTooltip($appointment),
                        'can_edit' => $this->canEditAppointment($appointment),
                    ])
                )
                ->toArray();
        });
    }

    public function getFormSchema(): array
    {
        return [
            'appointment_details' => Section::make('Dettagli Appuntamento')
                ->schema([
                    Select::make('patient_id')
                        ->relationship('patient', 'full_name')
                        ->searchable()
                        ->required(),
                    Select::make('type')
                        ->options(AppointmentType::class)
                        ->required(),
                    DateTimePicker::make('start_time')
                        ->required(),
                    DateTimePicker::make('end_time')
                        ->required(),
                    Select::make('status')
                        ->options(AppointmentStatus::class)
                        ->default(AppointmentStatus::SCHEDULED),
                    Textarea::make('notes')
                        ->rows(3),
                    Toggle::make('emergency'),
                ]),
        ];
    }
}
```

### 3. AdminCalendarWidget
- **Estende**: `Saade\FilamentFullCalendar\Widgets\FullCalendarWidget`
- **Namespace**: `Modules\SaluteOra\Filament\Widgets\AdminCalendarWidget`
- **Modello**: `Appointment`
- **Vista**: `dayGridMonth`
- **Accesso**: Solo admin
- **Filtro**: Tutti gli appuntamenti (opzionale per studio)
